OL,3,GNEWSAMinister visits derailment site
OL,4,Aamid funding plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rail minister has visited the site
OL,7,Fof a derailment in East Sussex amid
OL,8,Fcalls for more investment in transport
OL,9,Fin the South East.
OL,11,FRail Minister Lord Hendy met Lewes MP
OL,12,FJames MacCleary and senior
OL,13,Frepresentatives from Network Rail,
OL,14,FGreater Thameslink Railway, British
OL,15,FTransport Police and contractors
OL,16,Ffollowing the derailment near Lewes.
OL,18,FTwenty people were injured when three
OL,19,Fcarriages on the 14:24 BST Southern
OL,20,Fservice from London Victoria to
OL,21,FEastbourne left the tracks at Landport
OL,22,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
