OL,3,GNEWSAMinister visits derailment site
OL,4,Aamid funding plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacCleary said while he could not
OL,7,Fpre-empt the investigation, concerns
OL,8,Fabout infrastructure must be
OL,9,Fconsidered. Lord Hendy said regulators
OL,10,Fensured Network Rail had enough money
OL,11,Fto maintain the railway.
